WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.790
Right this way to our cabaret, don't wait to be invited.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.270
Just check your gloom, you'll all find room.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.850
Come in and get excited.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.240
Then shake your feet, sit down and eat.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.100
Corn beef or macaroni.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:17.740
Fight, but...

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:33.640
Greenhouse potatoes to french-fried tomatoes and...

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:33.700
Oh!

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:48.210
I'm untapped.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.340
Trop ambitious, micronicious, moxiness.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.550
Hot roast duck with a green jazooza now.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:53.200
Look out.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:07.660
Thank you.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.440
Da-da-da-da.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:38.860
We'll be right back.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.920
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.160
Thank you.
